# corpus/caps
profile own
summary make take direct
scope.begin first
call.enter factory make
new r R
new owner O hidden=r
cap view owner
call.exit factory view
bind view_bind view
use view
check ''
array copies view view
use copies
scope.end first
check OR
reset.log
scope.begin second
new r2 R
new original O hidden=r2
bind original_bind original
cap view2 original
scope.begin inner
new successor S hidden=r2
succ successor
cap successor_view successor
use successor
use successor_view
scope.end inner
check S
use view2
emit.label original
emit '|'
scope.end second
check 'SO|OR'
